  "job_B14.30.1_20251003_114308": {
    "text": "\u00d0is is seo ger\u00e6dnys, \u00fee Cnut ciningc, ealles Englalandes ciningc & Dena cining mid his witena\n\u00d0\u00e6t is \u00feonne \u00e6rest, \u00fe\u00e6t hi ofer ealle o\u00fere \u00feingc \u00e6nne God \u00e6fre woldan lufian & wur\u00f0ian & \u00e6nne\nAnd Godes cyrican gri\u00f0ian & fri\u00f0ian & gelomlice secean saulum to h\u00e6le & us sylfum to \u00feearfe.\n\u00c6lc cyrice is mid rihte on Cristes agenan gri\u00f0e; & \u00e6lc Cristen man ah mycele \u00feearfe, \u00fe\u00e6t he on \u00feam\n\u00deonne is swi\u00f0e rihtlic, \u00fe\u00e6t Godes circigri\u00f0 binnon wagum & Cristenes ciningces handgri\u00f0 stande \u00e6fre\nAnd gyf \u00e6fre \u00e6nig mann heonon for\u00f0 Godes cyricgri\u00f0 swa abrece, \u00fe\u00e6t he binnon ciricwagum\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00feonne \u00e6rest, \u00fe\u00e6t he his agenne wer Criste & \u00feam cyningce gesylle, & mid \u00feam hine sylfne\n& gif hit \u00feonne to bote gega, & se cyningc \u00fe\u00e6t ge\u00feafige, \u00feonne bete man \u00fe\u00e6t cyricgri\u00f0 into \u00fe\u00e6re\nAnd gyf elles be cwicum mannum ciricgri\u00f0 abrocen sy, bete man georne be \u00feam \u00fee seo d\u00e6d sy, sy hit\nBete man \u00e6rest \u00feone gri\u00f0bryce into \u00fe\u00e6re cyrican, be \u00feam \u00fee seo d\u00e6d sy & be \u00feam \u00fee \u00f0\u00e6re cyricean\nNe synd ealle cyricean na gelicre m\u00e6\u00f0e woruldlice wur\u00f0scipes wyr\u00f0e, \u00feeah hig godcundlice habban\nHeafodmynstres gri\u00f0bryce is \u00e6t botwyr\u00feum \u00feingum be cingces munde, \u00fe\u00e6t is mid V pundum on Engla\nEallum Cristenum mannum gebyra\u00f0 swi\u00f0e rihte, \u00fe\u00e6t hig haligdom & hadas & gehalgode Godes hus \u00e6fre\nFor\u00feam, understande se \u00f0e cunne, mycel is & m\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t sacerd ah to donne folce to \u00feearfe, gif he his\nMycel is seo halsung & m\u00e6re is seo halgung, \u00fee deofla afyrsa\u00f0 & on fleame gebringe\u00f0, swa oft swa\n& swa hi do\u00f0 symle, swa oft swa hig geornlice inweardre heortan clypia\u00f0 to Criste & for folces neode\nAnd gyf hit geweor\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t man mid tyhtlan & mid uncr\u00e6ftum sacerd belecge, \u00fee regollice libbe, & he\n& \u00e6t \u00feryfealdre sp\u00e6ce ladige he, gyf he durre, eac on \u00feam husle mid twam his gehadan.\nGif man deacon tihtlige, \u00fee regollice libbe, anfealdre sp\u00e6ce, nime twegen his gehadan & ladige hine\n& gyf man hine tihtlige \u00feryfealdre sp\u00e6ce, nime VI his gehadan & ladige hine mid \u00f0am & beo he\nGif man folciscne m\u00e6ssepreost mid tihtlan belecge, \u00f0e regollif n\u00e6bbe, ladige hine swa diacon \u00fee\nAnd gyf man freondleasne weofod\u00feen mid tihtlan belecge, \u00fee a\u00f0fultum n\u00e6bbe, ga to corsn\u00e6de &\nAnd gyf man gehadodne mid f\u00e6h\u00fee belecge & secge, \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6re d\u00e6dbana o\u00f0\u00f0e r\u00e6dbana, ladige\n& gyf he sig m\u00e6gleas, ladige mid geferan o\u00f0\u00f0e on f\u00e6sten fo, gif he \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feurfe, & ga to corsn\u00e6de &\nAnd na \u00feearf \u00e6nig mynstermunuc ahw\u00e6r mid rihte f\u00e6h\u00f0bote biddan ne f\u00e6h\u00febote betan: he g\u00e6\u00f0 of\nAnd gyf m\u00e6ssepreost \u00e6fre ahw\u00e6r stande on leasre gewitnesse o\u00f0\u00f0e on m\u00e6nan a\u00f0e o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00feeofa gewita\n& gyf he ladian wylle, geladige \u00feonne be d\u00e6de m\u00e6\u00f0e, swa mid \u00feryfealdre swa mid anfealdre lade, be\nAnd we wylla\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lces hades menn georne gebugan, \u00e6lc to \u00feam rihte \u00fee him to gebyrige.\n& huru\u00feinga Godes \u00feeowas bisceopas & abbodas, munecas & mynecena, canonicas & nunnan to\n& ealle Godes \u00feeowas we bidda\u00f0 & l\u00e6ra\u00f0 & huru\u00feinga sacerdas, \u00fe\u00e6t hi Gode hyran & cl\u00e6nnesse\nFullgeorne hig witan, \u00fe\u00e6t hig nagon mid rihte \u00feurh h\u00e6med\u00feingc wifes gemanan.\n& se \u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s geswican wille & cl\u00e6nnesse healdan, h\u00e6bbe he Godes miltse & to woruldwur\u00f0scipe si\nAnd \u00e6ghwylc Cristen mann eac for his Drihtenes ege unrihth\u00e6med georne forbuge & godcunde lage\nAnd we l\u00e6ra\u00f0 & bidda\u00f0 & on Godes naman beoda\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig Cristen mann binnon VI manna sibf\u00e6ce\nNe on his gef\u00e6deran, ne on gehalgodre nunnan, ne on \u00e6l\u00e6tan \u00e6nig Cristen mann \u00e6fre ne gewifige.\nNe \u00e6nige forligru ahwar ne begange.\nNe na ma wifa \u00feonne an h\u00e6bbe, & \u00fe\u00e6t beo his beweddode wif, & beo be \u00fe\u00e6re anre, \u00fea hwile \u00fee heo\nAnd gel\u00e6ste mann Godes gerihta \u00e6ghwylce geare rihtlice georne.\n\u00de\u00e6t is sulh\u00e6lmesse XV niht ofer Eastran & geogu\u00fee teo\u00f0unge be Pentecosten & eor\u00f0w\u00e6stma be Ealra\n& gyf hwa \u00feonne \u00fea teo\u00feunge gel\u00e6stan nelle, swa we gecweden habba\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t is se teo\u00f0a \u00e6cer, ealswa\n& t\u00e6can him to \u00feam nigo\u00f0an d\u00e6le, & tod\u00e6le mann \u00fea eahta d\u00e6las on twa, & fo se landhlaford to\nAnd Romfeoh be Petres m\u00e6ssan; & se \u00f0e ofer \u00fe\u00e6ne d\u00e6g hit healde, agyfe \u00feam bisceope \u00fe\u00e6ne penig &\nAnd cyricsceat to Martines m\u00e6ssan. & se \u00f0e hine ofer \u00fe\u00e6ne d\u00e6g healde, agyfe hine \u00feam bisceope &\nGyf hwa \u00feonne \u00feegna sig, \u00fee on his boclande cyrican h\u00e6bbe, \u00fee legerstow on sig, gesylle \u00feone \u00feriddan\nAnd gyf hwa cyricean h\u00e6bbe, \u00fee legerstow on ne sig, do he of \u00f0am nigon d\u00e6lum his preoste \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t\n& ga \u00e6lc cyricsceat into \u00feam ealdan mynstre be \u00e6lcon frigan heor\u00f0e.\nAnd leohtgesceot \u00feriwa on geare: \u00e6rest on Easter\u00e6fen healfpenigwur\u00f0 wexes \u00e6t \u00e6lcere hide & eft on\nAnd sawlsceat is rihtast, \u00fe\u00e6t man symle gel\u00e6ste a \u00e6t openum gr\u00e6fe.\nAnd gyf man \u00e6nig lic of rihtscriftscire elles hw\u00e6r lecge, gel\u00e6ste man \u00feone sawlsceat swa \u00feeah into\nAnd ealle Godes gerihta fyr\u00f0rige man georne, ealswa hit \u00feearf is.\nAnd freolsa & f\u00e6stena healde mon rihtlice.\n& healde man \u00e6lces Sunnand\u00e6ges freolsunge fram S\u00e6ternesd\u00e6ges none o\u00f0 Monand\u00e6ges lihtingce &\n& Sunnandaga cypingce we forbeoda\u00f0 eac eornostlice & \u00e6lc folcgemot, butan hit for micelre\n& hunta\u00f0fara & ealra woruldlicra weorca on \u00feam halgan d\u00e6ge geswic\u00e6 man georne.\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t man \u00e6lc beboden f\u00e6sten healde, si hit ymbrenf\u00e6sten, si hit lengctenf\u00e6sten, si hit elles o\u00f0er\nAnd to sancta Marian m\u00e6ssan \u00e6lcere & to \u00e6lces apostoles m\u00e6ssan f\u00e6ste man, butan to Philippi &\nAnd na \u00feearf man na f\u00e6stan fram Eastran o\u00f0 Pentecosten, butan hwa gescrifen sig o\u00f0\u00f0e he elles\nAnd we forbeoda\u00f0 ordal & a\u00f0as freolsdagum & ymbrendagum & lengctendagum & rihtf\u00e6stendagum &\nAnd sancte Eadweardes m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g witan habba\u00f0 gecoren, \u00fe\u00e6t man freolsian sceal ofer eall\nAnd beo \u00feam halgum tidum, ealswa hit riht is, eallum Cristenum mannum sib & som gem\u00e6ne & \u00e6lc\n& gyf hwa o\u00f0rum sceole borh o\u00f0\u00f0e bote \u00e6t woruldlicum \u00feingum, gel\u00e6ste hit him georne \u00e6r o\u00f0\u00f0e\nAnd we bidda\u00f0 for Godes lufan, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc Cristen mann understande georne his agene \u00feearfe.\nFor\u00feam ealle we sceolon \u00e6nne timan gebidan, \u00feonne us w\u00e6re leofre \u00feonne eall \u00fe\u00e6t on middanearde\nAc \u00feonne we sceolan habban anfeald lean \u00f0\u00e6s \u00fee we on life \u00e6r geworhtan; wa \u00feam \u00feonne, \u00fee \u00e6r\nAc uton swi\u00f0e georne fram synnum gecyrran & ure \u00e6lc his misd\u00e6da urum scriftum geornlice\n& ure \u00e6lc o\u00f0rum beode \u00fe\u00e6t we willon, \u00fe\u00e6t man us beode: \u00fe\u00e6t is rihtlic dom & Gode swi\u00f0e\nFor\u00feam God \u00e6lmihtig us ealle geworhte & eft deopum ceape gebohte, \u00fe\u00e6t is mid his agenum life, \u00fee\nAc gehwylc Cristen man do, swa him \u00feearf is: gime his Cristendomes georne & gearwige hine eac to\n& word & weorc freonda gehwylc fadige mid rihte, & \u00f0a & wedd w\u00e6rlice healde.\n& \u00e6ghwylc unriht aweorpe man georne of \u00feysum earde, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee man don m\u00e6ge, & lufige Godes riht\nUton don eac georne, swa we gyt l\u00e6ran wylla\u00f0: utan beon a urum hlaforde holde & getrywe & \u00e6fre\nFor\u00f0am eal \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00e6fre for rihthlafordhelde do\u00f0, eall we hit do\u00f0 us sylfum to mycelre \u00feearfe; for\u00feam\nAnd eac ah hlaforda gehwylc \u00fe\u00e6s formycle \u00feearfe, \u00fe\u00e6t he his men rihtlice healde.\nAnd ealle Cristene men we l\u00e6ra\u00f0 swi\u00f0e georne, \u00fe\u00e6t hig inweardre heortan \u00e6fre God lufian & rihtne\nAnd we l\u00e6ra\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc Cristen man geleornige, \u00fe\u00e6t he huru cunne rihtne geleafan & ariht understandan\nFor\u00f0am mid \u00feam o\u00ferum sceal \u00e6lc Cristen mann hine to Gode gebiddan & mid \u00feam o\u00f0rum\nCrist sylf sang Pater noster \u00e6rest & \u00fe\u00e6t gebed his leorningccnihtum t\u00e6hte.\nAnd on \u00feam godcundan gebede syn VII gebedu; mid \u00feam se \u00f0e hit inweardlice gesing\u00f0, he ge\u00e6rnda\u00f0\nAc hu m\u00e6g \u00feone \u00e6fre \u00e6nig mann hine inweardlice to Gode gebiddan, butan he h\u00e6bbe inweardlice\nFor\u00feam he nah \u00e6fter for\u00f0si\u00f0e Cristenra manna gemanan ne on gehalgedan lictune to restene, ne he\nNe he ne by\u00f0 wel Cristen, \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t geleornian nele, ne he nah mid rihte o\u00f0res mannes to onfonne \u00e6t\nAnd we l\u00e6ra\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t man wi\u00f0 healice synna & wi\u00f0 deoflice d\u00e6da scylde swy\u00fee georne on \u00e6ghwylcne\nAnd we l\u00e6ra\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t man wi\u00f0 fulne galscipe & wi\u00f0 unrihth\u00e6med & wi\u00f0 \u00e6ghwylcne \u00e6wbryce warnige\n& we l\u00e6ra\u00f0 eac georne manna gehwylcne, \u00fe\u00e6t he Godes ege h\u00e6bbe symle on his gemynde, & d\u00e6ges &\nBisceopas syndan bydelas & Godes lage lareowas, & hi sceolon bodian & bysnian georne godcunde\nFor\u00feam wace by\u00f0 se hyrde funden to heorde, \u00fee nele \u00fea heorde, \u00fee he healdan sceal, mid hreame\nNis nan swa yfel scea\u00f0a, swa is deofol sylf: he by\u00f0 a ymbe \u00fe\u00e6t an, hu he on manna saulum m\u00e6st\n\u00deonne moton \u00fea hyrdas beon swy\u00f0e wacore & geornlice clypigende, \u00fee wi\u00f0 \u00feone \u00feeodscea\u00f0an folce\n& se \u00f0e oferhogie, \u00fe\u00e6t he Godes bodan hlyste, h\u00e6bbe him gem\u00e6ne \u00fe\u00e6t wi\u00f0 God sylfne.",
